      "en": "$tin_upthres1"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "The upper income ceiling of the 0% (first) income-tax band, i.e. the tax-free threshold of the progressive IRPP schedule. Used as Band_UpLim in tin_fr's SchedCalc (gross-tax computation) and tinkt_fr's SchedCalc (Imax recomputation). Matches the \"up to €11,600\" ceiling shown for the latest year in the taxes theme doc and in Table 2.77 of the country report."
    },
